# Quoin environment template. Copy to .env.local and fill in the value(s)
# specific to YOUR deployment. .env.local is gitignored — values you put there
# never reach the repo.

# Bare short-name of the reverse-proxy gateway host that serves
# http://<PUBLIC_HOST>/quoin/. Used only by vite.config.ts to widen the dev
# server's allowedHosts so DIRECT short-name access works. Proxied access
# already works because the gateway rewrites the Host header to localhost, so
# this is optional. Example values: a Tailscale short-name, "homelab", etc.
PUBLIC_HOST=
